{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113886","id":3092475943,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc64U3An","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113886","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113886.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113886.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113886","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113886/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113886/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113886/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ab135ca3c2e4d3ebe2f57d723956c32bd6f37e51","number":113886,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Wayland: Implement touch support","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #95256.\r\nSupersedes #113705.\r\n\r\n~~Needs some testing with input cancellation (system gesture), as I can't seem trigger it on sway.~~ Tested on Fedora 43.\r\n\r\nThis went really smoothly but, as we need to implement embedded game focus and popup menu tracking (along other things), it's already quite chunky.\r\n\r\nBecause of this I won't be looking _yet_ to add simple gesture recognition, but it looks ~~surprisingly simple~~ doable in our case (we'll see in another PR). We also need to implement generic alternatives to the `input_devices/pointing/android/enable_pan_and_scale_gestures` and `input_devices/pointing/android/enable_long_press_as_right_click` project settings (the editor is already covered).\r\n\r\nThat said, unlike other desktop DSes, I implemented the `is_touchscreen_available` method, which tells supported controls to turn on touch awareness (like touch drag scrolling on `Tree`), and various touch aids (like the 3d navigation gizmos at startup).\r\n\r\nThis offsets a lot the fact that we don't implement gesture support yet and should make the experience on mobile touch devices a lot better, akin to the android editor in some ways.\r\n\r\nLastly, it looks like this exacerbated the \"this should not happen\" DS warning issue, and I finally figured out why: we need to track when we send window mouse enter/leave events in a single place, instead of sending them out from each individual pointing device handling logic. Since this issue is deeper rooted, I'll look into this in another PR.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://ap